{"seq":6,"slug":"mcp-and-hooks","title":"MCP 接外部工具 · Hooks 29 事件 × 5 handler","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/coding-tools-snapshot/claude-code/mcp-and-hooks","wordCount":1259,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"mcp-接外部工具-hooks-29-事件-5-handler\">MCP 接外部工具 · Hooks 29 事件 × 5 handler</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CLAUDE.md 与 Skills 解决&quot;agent 该做什么 / 怎么做&quot;，本节解决&quot;agent 怎么接外部工具 / 怎么自动化&quot;。MCP 把外部服务（GitHub / Playwright / 内部 search 等）以标准协议暴露成 agent 可调用的工具；Hooks 把&quot;在 X 事件发生时跑 Y 动作&quot;固化成配置——<strong>29 个事件 × 5 种 handler 是 5 家工具里最细的事件粒度</strong>。</p>\n<p>两层各管一摊：<strong><code>.mcp.json</code> + <code>~/.claude.json</code> 管外部工具接入</strong>；<strong><code>.claude/settings.json</code> + 各 skill/subagent frontmatter <code>hooks:</code> 管事件自动化</strong>。把&quot;transport / 鉴权 / 帧上限&quot;与&quot;事件分组 / handler 类型&quot;两侧分别看清，配置上几乎不会再卡壳。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph MCP 层&#10;        MP1[&quot;.mcp.json 项目共享&quot;] --&gt; MCP[MCP 客户端]&#10;        MP2[&quot;~/.claude.json 用户全局&quot;] --&gt; MCP&#10;        PL[&quot;plugin bundled mcp.json&lt;br/&gt;${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}&quot;] --&gt; MCP&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Hooks 层&#10;        H1[&quot;.claude/settings.json&quot;] --&gt; HK[&quot;29 事件 × 5 handler&quot;]&#10;        H2[&quot;skill / subagent&lt;br/&gt;frontmatter hooks:&quot;] --&gt; HK&#10;    end&#10;    MCP --&gt; AGENT[Claude Code agent loop]&#10;    HK --&gt; AGENT\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph MCP 层\n        MP1[\".mcp.json 项目共享\"] --&gt; MCP[MCP 客户端]\n        MP2[\"~/.claude.json 用户全局\"] --&gt; MCP\n        PL[\"plugin bundled mcp.json&lt;br/&gt;${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}\"] --&gt; MCP\n    end\n    subgraph Hooks 层\n        H1[\".claude/settings.json\"] --&gt; HK[\"29 事件 × 5 handler\"]\n        H2[\"skill / subagent&lt;br/&gt;frontmatter hooks:\"] --&gt; HK\n    end\n    MCP --&gt; AGENT[Claude Code agent loop]\n    HK --&gt; AGENT</pre><h2 id=\"mcp-servers-三-transport-与配置两份叠加\">MCP servers · 三 transport 与配置两份叠加</h2><p>MCP 是接外部工具的标准协议；Claude Code 在 client 侧是一等支持，<strong>transport 三选一</strong>：<code>http</code> / <code>sse</code>（deprecated 但仍可用）/ <code>stdio</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// .mcp.json（项目根，commit 进版本控制让团队共用）&#10;{&#10;  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;github&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;http&quot;,&#10;      &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/&quot;,&#10;      &quot;headers&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;Authorization&quot;: &quot;Bearer ${GITHUB_MCP_TOKEN}&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;playwright&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,&#10;      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,&#10;      &quot;args&quot;: [&quot;@playwright/mcp@latest&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;internal-search&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;http&quot;,&#10;      &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://mcp.internal/search&quot;,&#10;      &quot;oauth&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;authorizationUrl&quot;: &quot;https://sso.internal/oauth/authorize&quot;,&#10;        &quot;tokenUrl&quot;: &quot;https://sso.internal/oauth/token&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// .mcp.json（项目根，commit 进版本控制让团队共用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mcpServers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"github\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"headers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"Authorization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bearer ${GITHUB_MCP_TOKEN}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"playwright\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"stdio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"npx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"args\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@playwright/mcp@latest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"internal-search\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://mcp.internal/search\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"oauth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"authorizationUrl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://sso.internal/oauth/authorize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"tokenUrl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://sso.internal/oauth/token\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>两份配置叠加</strong>：<code>.mcp.json</code> 项目共享、<code>~/.claude.json</code> 用户全局；<code>.claude/settings.json</code> 里 <code>enableAllProjectMcpServers: true</code> 一键启用项目所有 MCP server，避免每个 server 都被 <code>/permissions</code> 单独问一次。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Transport</th>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>适合场景</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>http</code></td>\n<td>HTTP/JSON-RPC + Streamable</td>\n<td>远端 SaaS、跨网络</td>\n<td>帧上限 16MB（2026-04 修复）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sse</code></td>\n<td>HTTP Server-Sent Events</td>\n<td>老版 server 兼容</td>\n<td><strong>deprecated</strong>，仍可用；新建议 <code>http</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>stdio</code></td>\n<td>子进程 stdin/stdout JSON-RPC</td>\n<td>本地工具（如 Playwright、Git）</td>\n<td>启动快、零网络开销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>HTTP/SSE 帧上限 16MB</strong>：2026-04 修复——之前 server 推大量截图 / 长 markdown 会被截断；现超出会自动拆帧重发。<code>list_changed</code> 让 server 端动态更新工具集（agent 不必重启）；连接断开走指数退避重连；push channels 支持 server 主动通知。</p>\n<h3 id=\"oauth-与-plugin-bundled\">OAuth 与 plugin bundled</h3><p>OAuth 流程通过 <code>/mcp</code> slash command 触发：选 server → 跳浏览器 → 回调 → token 落 <code>~/.claude/auth/mcp/&lt;server&gt;.json</code>。同一 MCP server 在 OpenCode / Codex CLI / Hermes / OpenClaw 上都能配，跨工具协同时 server 端只写一份即可。</p>\n<p>Plugin bundled MCP 用 <code>${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}</code> placeholder 引相对路径：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// &lt;plugin&gt;/.mcp.json&#10;{&#10;  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;my-plugin-tool&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,&#10;      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;node&quot;,&#10;      &quot;args&quot;: [&quot;${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/server/index.js&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// &#x3C;plugin>/.mcp.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mcpServers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"my-plugin-tool\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"stdio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"args\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/server/index.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这样 plugin 移到任何路径都能找到 server 入口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hooks-29-事件分四组\">Hooks · 29 事件分四组</h2><p>Hooks 是 Claude Code 在 5 家工具里<strong>事件最多的一项</strong>——29 个事件覆盖 session 生命周期、prompt/tool 调用、agent 状态、环境变化。2026 年还修了一个老问题：<strong>hook 异常不再能破坏 TUI（&quot;hook 不能 corrupt UI&quot;修复）</strong>，hook 失败现在只会被记进日志、agent 收到带 stderr 的失败信号，不再让 TUI 卡住。</p>\n<h3 id=\"29-事件分四组\">29 事件分四组</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组</th>\n<th>事件示例</th>\n<th>何时触发</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Session 生命周期</td>\n<td><code>SessionStart</code> / <code>Stop</code> / <code>PreCompact</code> / <code>PostCompact</code> / <code>Setup</code> / <code>SessionEnd</code></td>\n<td>会话起止、context 压缩前后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prompt / Tool</td>\n<td><code>UserPromptSubmit</code> / <code>UserPromptExpansion</code> / <code>PreToolUse</code> / <code>PostToolUse</code> / <code>PostToolUseFailure</code> / <code>PostToolBatch</code> / <code>PermissionRequest</code> / <code>PermissionDenied</code> / <code>Notification</code> / <code>InstructionsLoaded</code></td>\n<td>用户输入与工具调用前后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Agent 状态</td>\n<td><code>SubagentStart</code> / <code>SubagentStop</code> / <code>TaskCreated</code> / <code>TaskCompleted</code> / <code>StopFailure</code> / <code>TeammateIdle</code> / <code>Elicitation</code> / <code>ElicitationResult</code></td>\n<td>subagent / task 生命周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境变化</td>\n<td><code>WorktreeCreate</code> / <code>WorktreeRemove</code> / <code>FileChanged</code> / <code>CwdChanged</code> / <code>ConfigChange</code></td>\n<td>文件系统 / 工作区状态变化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"5-种-handler\">5 种 handler</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Handler 类型</th>\n<th>何时用</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>command</code></td>\n<td>跑本地 shell</td>\n<td><code>bun run lint</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>http</code></td>\n<td>调外部 webhook</td>\n<td>给 Slack 发通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>mcp_tool</code></td>\n<td>调 MCP server 工具</td>\n<td><code>playwright.screenshot</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>prompt</code></td>\n<td>把字符串注入下一次 prompt</td>\n<td>提醒 agent 某条约定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>agent</code></td>\n<td>spawn 一个 sub-agent 接手</td>\n<td>编译失败 → 自动让 Explore agent 诊断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// .claude/settings.json 片段&#10;{&#10;  &quot;hooks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;PostToolUse&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;matcher&quot;: &quot;Edit&quot;,&#10;        &quot;handler&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;command&quot;,&#10;          &quot;command&quot;: &quot;bun run lint --fix ${CLAUDE_FILE_PATH}&quot;&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;PreToolUse&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;matcher&quot;: &quot;Bash(rm:*)&quot;,&#10;        &quot;handler&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;prompt&quot;,&#10;          &quot;prompt&quot;: &quot;Confirm rm intent: ${CLAUDE_TOOL_ARGS}&quot;&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;PostToolUseFailure&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;matcher&quot;: &quot;Bash(npm test:*)&quot;,&#10;        &quot;handler&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;agent&quot;,&#10;          &quot;agent&quot;: &quot;explore&quot;&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    ]&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;enableAllProjectMcpServers&quot;: true&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// .claude/settings.json 片段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"hooks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"PostToolUse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"matcher\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Edit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"handler\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bun run lint --fix ${CLAUDE_FILE_PATH}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"PreToolUse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"matcher\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bash(rm:*)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"handler\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prompt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"prompt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Confirm rm intent: ${CLAUDE_TOOL_ARGS}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"PostToolUseFailure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"matcher\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bash(npm test:*)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"handler\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"agent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"agent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"explore\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"enableAllProjectMcpServers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>也可以把 hooks 嵌进 skill / subagent frontmatter，让 hook <strong>只在该 skill 触发时生效</strong>——这是 Claude Code 在抽象层级上比 Codex CLI（6 个事件、仅全局）灵活很多的地方。</p>\n<h3 id=\"配置面与-placeholder\">配置面与 placeholder</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置位置</th>\n<th>作用域</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>.claude/settings.json</code></td>\n<td>项目级 + commit</td>\n<td>团队规范（强制 lint、commit message）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.claude/settings.local.json</code></td>\n<td>项目级 + 本地</td>\n<td>个人实验、临时禁用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>~/.claude/settings.json</code></td>\n<td>用户级</td>\n<td>跨项目个人偏好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>plugin <code>hooks/hooks.json</code></td>\n<td>plugin bundled</td>\n<td>第三方 plugin 自带 hook</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>skill / subagent frontmatter <code>hooks:</code></td>\n<td>限定范围</td>\n<td>仅在该 skill / agent 触发时生效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>placeholder 支持：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}</code>：项目根绝对路径</li>\n<li><code>${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}</code>：当前 plugin 安装目录</li>\n<li><code>${CLAUDE_FILE_PATH}</code>：本次 tool 调用涉及的文件</li>\n<li><code>${CLAUDE_TOOL_ARGS}</code>：本次 tool 调用参数 JSON</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"跨工具对比与陷阱\">跨工具对比与陷阱</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项</th>\n<th>Claude Code</th>\n<th>Codex CLI</th>\n<th>OpenCode</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Hooks 事件数</td>\n<td><strong>29</strong></td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>~25 plugin events</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Handler 类型</td>\n<td>command/http/mcp_tool/prompt/agent</td>\n<td>command + JSON stdout 决策</td>\n<td>TS/JS plugin（任意逻辑）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MCP transport</td>\n<td>http / sse-deprecated / stdio</td>\n<td>stdio + Streamable HTTP</td>\n<td>stdio + Streamable HTTP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OAuth</td>\n<td><code>/mcp</code> slash</td>\n<td><code>codex mcp login</code></td>\n<td><code>opencode mcp auth</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>帧上限</td>\n<td><strong>16MB</strong>（2026-04 修复）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plugin bundled</td>\n<td><code>${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><code>.opencode/plugins/</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误解</th>\n<th>实际情况</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&quot;MCP server 装在哪台机器都得各装一遍&quot;</td>\n<td><code>.mcp.json</code> commit 进项目，团队成员 clone 仓库自动共享；OAuth token 各自登。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;SSE 是首选 MCP 传输&quot;</td>\n<td>SSE 已 deprecated（仍可用）；新建议用 <code>http</code> 或 <code>stdio</code>。HTTP/SSE 帧上限 16MB（2026-04 修复）。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;Hooks 是 25 个&quot;</td>\n<td>v2.1.x 截至 2026-05-14 是 <strong>29 个事件</strong>；handler 5 种（<code>command/http/mcp_tool/prompt/agent</code>）。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;Hook 只能写在 settings.json&quot;</td>\n<td>可以内嵌进 skill / subagent frontmatter <code>hooks:</code> 字段，让 hook 仅在该 skill 触发时生效。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;Hook 异常会把 TUI 卡死&quot;</td>\n<td>2026-04 修复：hook 失败现在只记日志、agent 收到 stderr 的失败信号，<strong>不会破坏 TUI</strong>。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;MCP server 改了我得重启 Claude&quot;</td>\n<td><code>list_changed</code> 让 server 端动态更新工具集，agent 不必重启；连接断开走指数退避重连。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;PostToolUseFailure 没有&quot;</td>\n<td>有——这是 2026 加入的细化事件，让&quot;失败时自动 spawn explore agent 诊断&quot;成为一行配置。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>两层各管一摊：<strong><code>.mcp.json</code> + <code>~/.claude.json</code> 管外部工具接入</strong>、<strong><code>settings.json</code> + frontmatter <code>hooks:</code> 管事件自动化</strong>。</li>\n<li>MCP 三 transport：<code>http</code>（首选）/ <code>sse-deprecated</code> / <code>stdio</code>；<code>.mcp.json</code> 项目共享 + <code>~/.claude.json</code> 用户全局；<code>enableAllProjectMcpServers: true</code> 一键启用；<strong>HTTP/SSE 帧上限 16MB</strong>（2026-04 修复）；OAuth 走 <code>/mcp</code> slash；plugin bundled 用 <code>${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}</code>。</li>\n<li>Hooks <strong>29 个事件 × 5 种 handler</strong>：事件分四组（session 生命周期 / prompt-tool / agent 状态 / 环境变化）；handler 五种（command / http / mcp_tool / prompt / agent）；可嵌进 settings.json 或 skill / subagent frontmatter。</li>\n<li>2026 修复：<strong>hook 异常不再能破坏 TUI</strong>——失败只记日志，agent 收到 stderr 失败信号。</li>\n<li>placeholder 四件套：<code>${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}</code> / <code>${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}</code> / <code>${CLAUDE_FILE_PATH}</code> / <code>${CLAUDE_TOOL_ARGS}</code>，让 hook 命令自适应路径与参数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"MCP 接外部工具 · Hooks 29 事件 × 5 handler","id":"mcp-接外部工具-hooks-29-事件-5-handler"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"MCP servers · 三 transport 与配置两份叠加","id":"mcp-servers-三-transport-与配置两份叠加"},{"level":3,"text":"OAuth 与 plugin bundled","id":"oauth-与-plugin-bundled"},{"level":2,"text":"Hooks · 29 事件分四组","id":"hooks-29-事件分四组"},{"level":3,"text":"29 事件分四组","id":"29-事件分四组"},{"level":3,"text":"5 种 handler","id":"5-种-handler"},{"level":3,"text":"配置面与 placeholder","id":"配置面与-placeholder"},{"level":2,"text":"跨工具对比与陷阱","id":"跨工具对比与陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CLAUDE.md 多层加载 · Skills 14+ frontmatter 字段","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/coding-tools-snapshot/claude-code/claude-md-and-skills"},"next":null}